{
  "id": 10796345557297,
  "title": "Car Metal Rust Repair Paste",
  "handle": "car-metal-rust-repair-paste",
  "description": "<p><strong><span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">FEATURES</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SUPERIOR MOISTURE BARRIER</strong><strong> - </strong>The high-viscosity white paste penetrates metal pores, creating an impenetrable seal that prevents new rust from forming even in humid conditions.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0964/2354/3089/files/spp_shopify20260902175958_d82f34d21082d6429fbb493395943e37.jpg?v=1788343201\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>ALL-WEATHER SHIELD</strong><strong> - </strong>Engineered for durability, it remains flexible and protective across extreme temperature swings and high-salt road environments during winter seasons.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0964/2354/3089/files/spp_shopify20260902180001_eee8fe16a11799570d096de7d1eef1ff.jpg?v=1788343205\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>ENGINEERED SHIELD FORMULA</strong><strong> - </strong>Our specialized formula features high-viscosity resins and fine synthetic bristles for a clean, non-drip application that stays where you put it.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0964/2354/3089/files/spp_shopify20260902180005_68a4b012b477a9ca71723dbfbecea213.jpg?v=1788343208\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>EASY DIY REPAIR</strong><strong> - </strong>Designed for accessibility, the included applicator brush allows for precise control in tight crevices like wheel arches and door seams without mess.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0964/2354/3089/files/spp_shopify20260902180009_3f9224ef7a7b01aebb883119b775d511.jpg?v=1788343212\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>UNIVERSAL AUTO PROTECTION</strong><strong> - </strong>From hidden chassis components to visible wheel arches and door seams, it provides comprehensive protection against oxidative damage vehicle-wide.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0964/2354/3089/files/spp_shopify20260902180013_320b9dff56d576bee7914c1109a5055a.jpg?v=1788343216\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">SPEC</span></strong></p>\n<p>Capacity: 30 ml (1.01 fl oz)</p>\n<p>Product Dimensions: 4 x 4 x 4 cm (1.57 x 1.57 x 1.57 inches)</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">PACKAGE INCLUDES</span></strong></p>\n<p>1 x Auto Rust Shield Paste</p>\n<p>1 x Applicator Brush</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">NOTES</span></strong></p>\n<p>Clean the metal surface thoroughly to remove loose rust and grease before applying the paste.</p>\n<p>Allow the paste to cure fully for 2 to 4 hours depending on local temperature and humidity.</p>\n<p>Store in a cool, dry place out of reach of children and pets.</p>",
